@startuml uc005-ssd
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
title UC-005 Generate report: system sequence diagram

actor Developer
participant "JudgeLab" as System
actor "Output directory" as Store

note over Developer, System
  Triggered inside a run (UC-006), once every
  case has an outcome: PASS, FAIL or ERROR.
end note

System -> System : summarise run(results)
alt at least one case reached a verdict
  System -> System : pass rate = passed / evaluated, coverage = evaluated / total
else 1a: no case reached a verdict
  System -> System : pass rate = null, coverage = 0.0
end
System -> System : build report(run metadata, summary, case entries)
opt 5a: the directory does not exist
  System -> Store : create directory
end
System -> Store : write report(run-<start>-<run id prefix>.json, UTF-8 JSON)
System --> Developer : report path (printed by UC-006)
@enduml
